---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { mailto, resumeUrl, github, linkedin } from '../data/site';
import Squiggle from '../components/Squiggle.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Layout
  title="About — Param Dave"
  description="Param Dave is a research-minded ML engineer and product builder who connects business KPIs to model behavior and shipped AI systems."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pt-11 pb-9 sm:pt-14">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-amber-600 uppercase dark:text-amber-400">
      About
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
      I connect business outcomes to model behavior and build the system in between.
    </h1>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] lg:gap-14">
      <div class="space-y-5 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
        <p>
          Right now I'm a Senior Machine Learning Engineer at TRC Inc, working remotely from
          India. I build agentic AI systems, evaluation frameworks, document-intelligence
          pipelines, and 3D intelligence systems — work where plausible output isn't enough
          and the system has to be measurable, diagnosable, and reliable inside a real
          workflow.
        </p>
        <p>
          My core interests are robotics, computer vision, and 3D perception: SfM at
          scale, Gaussian Splatting for real-time rendering, and LiDAR segmentation for
          utility infrastructure. That work taught me that reproducing a paper is only the
          beginning. Data quality, runtime, evaluation design, and deployment constraints
          often contain the harder research questions.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today I apply the same mindset to LLM systems, and the loop runs in both directions:
          production failures decide which research questions are worth my time, and the
          experiments decide what ships next.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="rounded-xl border border-stone-200 p-5 dark:border-stone-800">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">Current coordinates</p>
        <dl class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm">
          <div>
            <dt class="text-stone-500">Role</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 font-medium">Senior Machine Learning Engineer</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-stone-500">Based in</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 font-medium">India · working remotely</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-stone-500">Current focus</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 font-medium">Reliable agents, evaluation, and inference</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-stone-500">Operating range</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 font-medium">Business KPI → application → model → evaluation</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a
        href={`${base}/experience`}
        class="rounded-md bg-stone-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-stone-700 dark:bg-amber-400 dark:text-stone-900 dark:hover:bg-amber-300"
      >
        Full experience →
      </a>
      <a
        href={`${base}/skills`}
        class="rounded-md border border-stone-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:border-stone-500 dark:border-stone-700 dark:hover:border-stone-500"
      >
        Technical toolkit
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-10">
    <Squiggle class="mb-12" />
    <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">Education</h2>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">M.E. Robotics</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">University of Maryland, College Park</p>
            </div>
            <span class="shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-stone-500">2023</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">B.E. Mechanical Engineering</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">Nirma University, India</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">The non-CV version</h2>
        <blockquote class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-amber-500 pl-4">
          <p class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
            "We are a way for the cosmos to know itself."
          </p>
          <footer class="mt-2 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">
            <cite class="not-italic">Carl Sagan, Cosmos</cite>
          </footer>
        </blockquote>
        <dl class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm">
          <div>
            <dt class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wider text-amber-600 uppercase dark:text-amber-400">Perspective</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
              I look at stars for perspective and model traces for root causes.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wider text-amber-600 uppercase dark:text-amber-400">Open tabs</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
              History, markets, geopolitics, and theology — an efficient way to never run out of them.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wider text-amber-600 uppercase dark:text-amber-400">Reset protocol</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
              Running, hiking, lifting, football, cricket, or tennis. Most existential questions improve after moving.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wider text-amber-600 uppercase dark:text-amber-400">Cooldown</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">Sitcoms, preferably with no debugging required.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-10">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">Get in touch</h2>
      <dl class="mt-6 grid gap-5 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <div>
          <dt class="text-stone-500">Email</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1">
            <a href={mailto} class="font-medium hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">
              Write to me
            </a>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-stone-500">LinkedIn</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1">
            <a href={linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="font-medium hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">
              /in/param-dave ↗
            </a>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-stone-500">GitHub</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1">
            <a href={github} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="font-medium hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">
              @ParamDave5 ↗
            </a>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-stone-500">Résumé</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1">
            <a href={resumeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="font-medium hover:text-amber-600 dark:hover:text-amber-400">
              View résumé ↗
            </a>
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
